@startuml SD_UC_E3_1_Request_Checkout
autonumber
skinparam style strictuml
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI", Arial, sans-serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 14

actor "Phục vụ" as Waitstaff
boundary "App Phục vụ" as MobileUI
control "InvoiceController" as Controller
participant "InvoiceService" as Service
participant "TableRepository" as Repo
database "SQL Server" as DB
boundary "Web POS Quầy" as WebPOS
actor "Thu ngân" as Cashier

Waitstaff -> MobileUI: Chọn bàn \n& Bấm "Yêu cầu tính tiền"
activate MobileUI

MobileUI -> Controller: POST /api/tables/{tableId}/request-checkout
activate Controller

Controller -> Service: RequestCheckout(tableId)
activate Service

Service -> Repo: GetTableWithActiveOrder(tableId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: SELECT TableStatus, ActiveOrderId
activate DB
DB --> Repo: Table (Status = Occupied)
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: TableData
deactivate Repo

Service -> Repo: SetTablePaymentPending(tableId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DB: UPDATE Tables \nSET Status = 'PaymentPending'
activate DB
DB --> Repo: OK
deactivate DB
Repo --> Service: Updated
deactivate Repo

Service -> WebPOS: PushSignalR("BillRequested", tableId)
WebPOS --> Cashier: Thông báo bàn yêu cầu tính tiền

Service --> Controller: Result(Success)
deactivate Service

Controller --> MobileUI: 200 OK
deactivate Controller

MobileUI --> Waitstaff: Đã gửi yêu cầu 
deactivate MobileUI

@enduml
